      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aurora%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Aurora hosts the DeLaney Round Barn, a 1902 structure on the National Register of Historic Places, surrounded by 130 acres of trails and open space.",
